; Breaker-panel body. Deliberately a DIFFERENT hue family from both the
; dispenser (warm gray-green) and the keypad (cool slate-blue): near-neutral
; industrial charcoal, darker than either, so a player who has learned "teal
; box = keypad, pale box = dispenser" does not read this as a third keypad —
; which is the entire reason the Three.js build gave the switch its own
; MatName ('breaker') rather than reusing 'pad'. Metallic pinned low per
; MIGRATION_NOTES (no sky, no reflection probes).

